Bind Npc 25001 Zone 21
Quest 1215 "Not enough time"
    Journal "Bring Apples of Moradon."
    Collect 4 of 810418000

Requires player level >= 20 and quest 1214 is completed

Rewards
    Give 75000 experience

On offer
    Say "There isn't a day I can rest! As you know, pirates are trying to invade Moradon. We need to do something about it."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Since we don't have enough food to get to Mora Island, we will need Apples of Moradon, and  Hm..  I think the scorpions have a habit of collecting Apples of Moradon..."

